le to \"shit or get off the pot\".It wasn't done.  For those of you who do not know, or who have prescribed tothe rumors that abound.  I was banned by mistake.  I was kept away and putoff without reason.  Untrustworty was heard. All sorts of things.For the brief time i was unbanned, i was NEVER returned to my position,although it was a mistake that i lost it.  I was kept and treated asa wiz with suspicion, and comments being made about me.  It sucked.I was restored to my position.  Airborne said it was a check on Mangla.Mangla said it was to bring back HM.  Silas voted for me cause i asked him.In the time that i made elder, I restored the ninja with wilbie, tinman,and bobo, restored the summoners with redsexy.  recruited and set up7 new Gm's, reviewed and opened 5 areas, coded a clan system, and fixed2 whole areas.  There is much more that needs done.  And i log on everyday to find some social archwizard speaking down from above.  Or activeones talking down about me or to me.  Telling me what is wrong with me, and refusing to listen to all the facts established about what is wrongwith what they have done.  I have done archwizard work.  I was an archwizard.I have used elder position to help everyone on here, even the assholes.Many other wizards have been inspired to come back, but that momentum is dying.They have been put off, forgotten, while the ALL important archwizardssit back for a month to discuss things.  Redsexy was ignored for a year.Her area forgotten.  Bobo has done more coding than any other personat his rank, he is ignored and put off.  I don't blame him for cutting back.There are wizards that are banished and wanted to come back, but they areignored.  And Exos is still here even after the testimony of 7 or 8 peopleattested to his absolute wrongdoings.After the ninja guild was restored, players and wizards started calling fornew archwizards with my name being mentioned many times.  These people weretold point blank to shut the hell up.  I have no conception of whatyou arches have going on in that little room, and what bullshit ideas arefloating around.  But face it. One coding arch, isn't going to cut it.The mud blew up in sargons workroom, understandings were reached, Then ignored.That Tuesday came and went a month ago.  The old ways are no longer needed.Who is gonna help you put in the 100 level system? Airborne? Silas?Kryll?, maybe Warlord and Uglymoth.  Maybe Sauron when he comes back fromhis next extended vacation.  Hello, Tatsuo has the ability, and has shown it.The mantras of me being some evil son of a bitch won't work forever whenthey are demonstrably untrue.  You know what Redsexy is right, I am BOTH.I cannot fathom the resistance to the move when everything points to a positive.When there is a chance to remove the dead weight and move up the peoplethat are bringing back the players.  The momentum as you put it is starting to slipwith the players.  I can spark it back up.  I will claim responsibilityfor a large percent of the comeback that is started.  I give the rest to thepeople who have been ignored and put off.  From what i know, there arepotentially 3 mudlib level coders on the game besides you Mangla.Those are your archwizards.Tatsuo, Wilbie, and Sargon.Please stop bogarting the highest position in the game when others can fill those positions.  calling kryll to login hasn't made him come back and fix theplace. and saurons instant appearance also has done little but piss me off.Put the level where the level belongs.  With the people that code this place,and enjoy it.You want the 100 level system in, arch those people.You want the guilds running and balanced, arch those people.You want players coming back, arch those people.You want new players, arch those people.You want wizards coding and being helped with code, arch those people.You want Holy Mission back, arch those people.If you want things the way they were. Sit back and dicuss things some more withthe deadbeats that brought her down.Make some changes, shake the boat. Take action, make it fun.If not, I am outta here.  I have forwarded this to every wiz that gives a damn, and i will ask thatthese wizzes write their feelings to MANGLA and cc it to TATSUO.  I wanta clean and open debate.  I also ask that it not be sent to other archeswhose feelings may be hurt by it.  That is not my intention.  I i havespoken an untruth, let it be known.  If i am right, tell mangla to fix theplace.Tatsuo, for Holy Mission**tatsuo**To: redsexyFwd:  mailCc: bobo, uruz, waldo, wilbie, tinman, thumperDate: Mar 22To: manglaSubj: mailCc: tatsuoDate: Mar 22I recently reseved a letter that had some stronge statements made in it.Odds are you know the one I am talking about. We stand at a cross roads,it is no secret that this mud is dead, but there is hope. Recently the oldcoders have returned, and with them some new players. This mud can begreat once again. \"These are the time that try mens souls\" Henry V. Isay that because people don't seem to like change, it seems to try theresouls. Well its time to put the games aside and start to do what is bestfor the mud. Tatsuo has shown that he can get things done. Why then dowe not let him do this. The answer would seem to be with the arches. I haveno clue what you guys do, but I see what you don't do, and this is helpthis place. We need new arches and new changes to be made. I FULLY suportthe ideas set forth by Tatsuo and some of the others wizes. Given thisI stand with them and or walk with them, please let it be the former thanthe latter.                                       Akira**tatsuo**To: redsexyFwd:  Tatsuo / ArchwizCc: sargon, akira, uruz, waldo, wilbie, bobo, tinman, widge, icehouse, atiDate: Mar 22To: manglaSubj: Tatsuo / ArchwizCc: tatsuoDate: Mar 22Well I'm only a beginner, and actually this is the 1st MUD i've ever been on. And I may not know 