rne acts as sortof a check - just to keep things balanced.As for the other arches, how in the hell can a person be considered an archwhen they never log on and do anything?  Popping in now and then to vote onsomething that you don't even care about doesn't count.This is also not a rip on Mangla.  Personally, I have no problem with Mangla.The problem I have is that Mangla (purposely or not) has placed the entireMud on his shoulders.  One person just doesn't cut it.  It doesn't matter ifyou have the best intentions in the world.  One person does not make a mud.Personally, I think Tatsuo would make a very good arch.  Quite frankly, I think a great number of the people we have right now would make great arches.Let's stop thinking of the \"arch\" position as some elite rank.  It's just another level with more work involved.  If someone has the ability, and thedesire, they should be given the opportunity to do the work.  They certainly have more business with that rank than someone who neverlogs in.One last thing, for the record.  I don't want to be an arch.  If raising mylevel will help me help this mud then yes, I'm all for promotion.  Promoteme to whatever I can best help you with.  To me, that's all rank is.  It'saccess to do more good for the Mud.**satia**To: redsexySubj: fantasiaCc:  Date: Mar 24I will be on Fantasia for a bit:206.129.8.221 4030**allsiante**To: redsexySubj: just a wordDate: Mar 26Hi !I gotta go now, but i'll be back in a few hours or tomorrow - for sure.Im level 17 now and need 5% for 18 - almost full stats, just wis and chr arent fulli think i'm doin good :)so see ya laterbye ! - and kissesAllsiante**morrolan**To: redsexySubj: ideaDate: Mar 27hey..i have an idea for a diff area other than colossus'i'll let you know next time i see you-mark**wilbie**To: redsexySubj: StrikeCc: sargon, shadowmonk, nae, bobo, nunu, turbo, tinman, thumper, akira, nylakoorubDate: Mar 27I propose a coding strike, to let the arches know that we are not going toput up with their shit anymore.  They have had THREE YEARS to get this mudback together, and so far they've failed miserably.  Furthermore, they'veallowed personal vandettas to hinder the progress of the mud.I suggest the following conditions to begin coding again:1.  Reinstate Tatsuo.  That's a given.  He's done more for this mud in a    month than all of the arches did in three years.2.  Demote ALL inactive arches.  Kryll, Magnal, Sauron, Airborne.  These four    have done nothing for three years.  Sauron has been \"working on the lib\",    Airborne comes in to read boards, and Kryll hasn't done shit.  As for    Magnal - who the hell is Magnal?  3.  Mangla must either step down from arch or promote at    LEAST one more arch in order to balance the power.If you agree to this, post it.  If not, do whatever you like.  Personally,I don't see the point of having the mud if things stay as they are.**wilbie**To: akiraSubj: strikeCc: nae, turbo, bobo, nunu, redsexyDate: Mar 29The whole point of the strike was not to stop the mud.  The point was toshow the arches that we're united.  But I guess we're not.  I guess only afew of us give a rat's ass that the mud is falling apart.Nae - I agree, this is only a game.  It's supposed to be a fun game.  But I'll tell you what Nae...  After you've spent the time coding hundreds ofrooms, items, and monsters, and after you've spend the time testing and recoding a few guilds - only to have it mean NOTHING because a couple archwizards decide to play dictator - you tell me you're not a little pissed about it.  You listen to three years of bullshit and tell me you'renot frustrated.  At the very least, I would have at least expected a litte consideration fromyou.  I thought we were friends - my mistake.As for the rest of you, I'll say it again.  It's your mud...  if you want it,you've gotta take it.There's a good chance that I'll be banished soon - it's how our arches dealwith us \"subversive\" types.  If I am, have a good one.  I hope the best forHoly Mission and for all of you.  Wilbiecphite@lightstream.net**wilbie**To: turboSubj: stuffCc: bobo, akira, redsexy, tuppence, nunuDate: Mar 29If anyone wants to keep in touch, please send me an emailat the following:cphite@lightstream.netInclude your ICQ number and nickname if you have one (if you don't haveICQ you should get it - you'll like it)...Thanks.**nae**To: wilbieRe:   strikeCc: nae, turbo, bobo, nunu, redsexy, akiraDate: Mar 30Yes, we ARE friends. But I'm sorry, I'm not a sheep.*I* don't agree with you that the arches are dictators.*I* dont agree that they're ruining the mud.I happen to think that the best way we can make themud better is to all work together... which is CLEARLYnot what you were asking for.I'm sorry. If you open a discussion, and call forresponses, dont act like it's the end of the worldwhen they dont agree with you.**mangla**To: sargonSubj: PromotionsCc: arches, tinman, shadowmonk, brainsprain, redsexy, bobo, turboDate: Mar 31As was promised, the promotions have been made.Thanks for your time and patience.-Mangla**bgs**To: redsexySubj: 'bout wizzing higherDate: Mar 31 Hi !McLoud told me that you would be my mentor. We didn't meet today :(First of all I tell you what the situation is...I started playing around '94 and was a player until 96-97 then wizzed.Becouse of the university and as I coded on some other muds I stayed at appr lvl.Now i'm a bit tired of being appr so i decided to make the \"big step\" and advanceto newwiz.I don't know if the 'test' changed lately so I don't know if I know everything the arch's want me to know. (This is not the first coding place for me andit is only a formality to make that test. I know what I should do az wizand I will refresh myself in LPC anyway).Uhm ... mangla just want to speak with me, i've gotta 